{"name":"Grandview","hex":"#6b927f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Grandview","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A number of places in Canada:\nA summer village in County of Wetaskiwin No. 10, Alberta.\nA rural municipality and community therein, in the Parkland Region of west Manitoba.\nA settlement in Prince Edward Island.\nA rural municipality in western Saskatchewan; in full, Rural Municipality of Grandview No. 349.","A summer village in County of Wetaskiwin No. 10, Alberta."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Grandview"}],"entries":[{"title":"Grand View Hotel","blocks":[{"text":"Grand View Hotel is a heritage-listed hotel at 49 North Street, Cleveland, City of Redland, Queensland, Australia. It was built c. 1852 onwards. It was also known as Brighton Hotel and Cleveland House. It was added to the Queensland Heritage Register on 21 October 1992."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Grand_View_Hotel_and_North_Street_Cleveland.jpg/330px-Grand_View_Hotel_and_North_Street_Cleveland.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_View_Hotel"},{"title":"Grand View University","blocks":[{"text":"Grand View University is a private liberal arts university in Des Moines, Iowa. Founded in 1896 and affiliated with the Evangelical Lutheran Church in America, the university enrolls approximately 2,000 students and is accredited by the Higher Learning Commission."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/The_Humphrey_Center_at_Grand_View.jpg/330px-The_Humphrey_Center_at_Grand_View.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_View_University"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/StateLibQld_1_176563_Brighton_Hotel_at_Cleveland%2C_ca._1903.jpg/500px-StateLibQld_1_176563_Brighton_Hotel_